   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Flickors utb, UNICEF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Girls Education UNICEF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet syftar till att &#xF6;ka inskrivingen av barn till skolan, i synnerhet flickor. Programmet vill &#xF6;ka inskriviningarna till formella skolan s&#xE5;v&#xE4;l sokm icke-formella undervisningen. Programmets andra komponenet syftar till att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra kvalit&#xE9;n av utbildningssystemet genom l&#xE4;rarutbildning, l&#xE4;roplansutveckling etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Girls&apos; education Programme (GEP) aims to promote access to education in particular for girls through formal and non-formal education, through supporting teaching and learning materials. The programme also promotes quality improvement through teacher training and curricula reform etc.</narrative>
  </description>
